<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Woolwich shares.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Woolwich shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 25 million American-style call warrants, on Woolwich shares, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3.0 STG		   ISS PRICE    0.52 STG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3.0 STG</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
